  "description": "Every web API the browser ships, generated from MDN's own data for Rask: MDN's globals and interfaces in C# (await Navigator.Clipboard.WriteText(\"hi\"), await Window.MatchMedia(query).Matches), each chain run in one round trip, on the server host over its socket and in WebAssembly in-process. Members are MDN's names with no Async suffix, their doc comments carry browser support and links to MDN, and an object you keep is a disposable handle.",
